1
00:00:00,233 --> 00:00:01,467
Five words you'll see

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:03,400
in every biomass tender.

3
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:05,500
And what they actually mean.

4
00:00:05,967 --> 00:00:07,100
EMD.

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,800
Earnest money deposit.

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,100
A refundable security

7
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,833
