8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,500
GCV.

9
00:00:13,867 --> 00:00:15,333
Gross calorific value.

10
00:00:15,433 --> 00:00:16,067
How much heat

11
00:00:16,067 --> 00:00:18,033
