12
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,000
Buyers always set a minimum.

13
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:21,233
L1.

14
00:00:21,333 --> 00:00:23,133
The lowest qualified bidder.

15
00:00:23,267 --> 00:00:24,300
In most tenders,

16
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,500
L1 wins.

17
00:00:25,767 --> 00:00:28,300
MSE exemption.

18
00:00:28,833 --> 00:00:29,633
Registered small businesses

19
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:31,700
